        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage JD80, One Sided Dexter Grade 3 Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis single sided deadbolt is used for locking and unlocking doors from the inside only. The thumbturn operates the deadbolt on one side of the door while, on the other side of the door, there is nothing. This ANSI Grade 3 Deadbolt does not go through to the outside of the door. Available in 5 finishes. It has an adjustable latch to fit 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets; and it will fit door thicknesses ranging from 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\". \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-dexter-deadbolt-schlage-jd60\"><b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt JD60 </b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/schlage-dexter-one-sided-deadbolt-with-exterior-plate-jd81\"><b>One Sided Deadbolt With Exterior Trim Deadbolt JD81</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage JD80 Single Sided Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>5 year Finish Warranty.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.5, 2001, Grade 3 deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>1\" deadbolt with hardened steel core that is resistant to sawing and kick-in attacks.</li>\r\n<li>Free spinning, solid metal cylinder collar resist wrench and hammer attacks as well as prying.</li>\r\n<li>Drill-resistant metal faceplate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Schlage JD 80 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc-Based plated to matched the finish you choose.</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness Range: 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Height: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>One-Sided Deadbolt:</b> The deadbolt thrown or retracted from interior side only. There is no plate or exposed trim on the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Note</b> This item is now <b>Discontinued</b>. \r\nUse <a href=\"/products/one-sided-deadbolt-schlage-b80\"><b>Schlage B80</b></a>\r\n</p>",
